  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that scvi_n200 (config_004) outperforms pca_n2000 (config_001) in RNA-only singleprofile models. This experiment tests whether using scvi_n200 with multiprofile (vs singleprofile) improves performance, isolating the impact of profile setting. It builds on the strong evidence for scvi_n200 while exploring a key design choice (multiprofile) that remains untested. This balances exploitation of the better encoder with exploration of a critical architectural decision."
